      "field": "response_note",
      "old": null,
      "new": "Participants were randomly assigned to interface-order Groups A and B. Group A used the conversational interface for Scenario 1, followed by the graphical interface for Scenario 2; Group B used the graphical interface for Scenario 1, followed by the conversational interface for Scenario 2. Each participant used both interfaces on different scenarios. The described scenario order is fixed (Scenario 1, then Scenario 2). Random assignment concerns the interface-order groups, not randomized scenario order. See primary report Section 4.2, PDF pages 6–7."
